<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">1 KOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ko</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wuntete wu Pawuli ku bisi-Kolinto</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wuntete wu Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ni Pawuli wusonika mukanda bewuwu ku minkwikidi mii mbanza yi Kolinto. Wuyenda koko mu nzyetolo andi yinzole, mumvu wumosi na ngonda sambanu kahyokisa koko. Ni mu ntangu beyoyo kalongila balembolo ba Bayudayo natee bu batambula Klisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu ntangu beyoyo mbanza Kolinto yiba nkatika mbanza yimbote: Masuwa medi kwizanga koko, medi fumanga ndambu ka ndambu mpe minkiti mimingi mi ba koko. Yobobo bedi sanga kinsuza baba mpe babingi koko, bonso bukwe banga mu zimbanza zimvimba zizinene. Ni balenda mu hukumuna minkwikidi mi mbanza yi Kolinto. Musamu bewowo wukotisa Pawuli mu mayindu mamingi, ni kabwesa basonikina mukanda wuhiika wuntete (tala 1 Kol 5.9), mu bateela mu lembolo ba kintwadi na bantu bebobo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bulendi ba ti bisi-Kolinto bamusonikina. Kansi misamu mimingi balembolo sadila mu malongi ma bahaana Pawuli. Bantu bahiika bayiza yadila Pawuli mpolo zi bisi-Kolinto, mpe ziba zimbote ko. Ni kabonga nzengolo mu bavutudila mvutu mu mukanda wu bamusonikina, ni kabahaana mpe malongi momo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wubahaana malongi mu misamu mimingi bonso nkabani zi minkwikidi, kindumba, makwela, kudya mbizi zi baheeni minkayulu ku nzambi zi biteki, bindya bi Mfumu na minkayulu mikwe haananga Mpeve Yilongo, mpe mfulukulu mu bafwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wukikulula ha ntadisi awu mu bateela mi kakana mu ta. Wubalonka mpe ti mu hidika misamu bemyomyo, bafweti kangama kaka nakekete mu Klisto. Wuta dyaka ti kuzola mfinangani aku, kuvudidi bunene mu misamu mimvimba.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-9">1.1-9</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Malongi mu bika mu nwana na mu hambana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1.10–4.21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Malongi mulembolo sa bumbi ku bahiika (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-6:20">5.1–6.20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Babakala na bakento bawu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 7:1-40">7.1-40</ref> </char> )</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Kutumimina Nzambi, kansi ka biteki ko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 8:1-11:1">8.1–11.1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Ndyatulu yi minkwikidi mu mabundu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 11:2-14:40">11.2–14.40</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Klisto wubedisa lufwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:1-58">15.1-58</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">8) Lusadusu ku bamputu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">16.1-4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">9) Nzyetolo yi Pawuli (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:5-12">16.5-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">10) Malongi na zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:13-24">16.13-24</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto, wutambula mbokolo yi Nzambi mu luzolo lwandi na mpangi ani Sositeni.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Tuna sonika mukanda ku yeno dibundu di Nzambi dii ku mbanza Kolinto, yobobo bavwihulu ku Nzambi mu Yesu-Klisto, bakatumisa mu zinga nandi kintwadi na bamvimba bakwe sambilanga mu bibuka bimvimba nkumbu yi Yesu, wudi Mfumu awu na Mfumu eto. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Bika Nzambi Tata dyeto na Mfumu Yesu Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misamu mimbote mi tutambudi mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Tukwe tatamananga mu vutula matondo ku Nzambi eto mu dyambu dyeno mu mulemvo wu kalusila mu Yesu Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Mu dyambu ti, mu Yesu lutambudi bimvwama bimvimba bi minkayilu, sungula munkayulu we longa na wu nzayilu. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Kimbangi ki Klisto ki balusamunina, kya luna toma kwikilanga mu ngolo zimvimba, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />buna, kuu na munkayulu wuhaana Nzambi wulembolo ba neeno ko, ku yeno luna kingila kilokola kyaayenika Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Yandi waalusyamisa natee ku nsukunu, mwanki lulembolo ba na dyambu dye lusembila mu kilumbu ki Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nzambi yandi bende wulutumisa mu zinga mu kintwadi na Mwana andi Yesu-Klisto Mfumu eto: Yandi wukwikama kadi mu nsilulu zandi.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkabani mu dibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Mpangi zani, nina lubombidila mu nkumbu yi Mfumu eto Yesu Klisto: yuwasaneeno, lubandi na nkabani ha kati dyeno ko. Kansi, tomeeno ba bakangama mu kintwadi na beeno na mpeve yimosi mpe mayindu mamosi. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Mpangi zani, bantu baa mu kanda di Kolowe bantedidi ti mbakani zii neeno yeno na yeno. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Nina kwe yuwingi ha kati dyeno ti: ewu wuna ta: «Meno muntu wu Pawuli nidi», wuhiika wuna ta ti: «Meno muntu wu Apolose», wuhiika dyaka ti: «Meno muntu wu Sefase», wuhiika dyaka ti: «Meno muntu wu Klisto nidi!» <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Luna banzila ti Klisto wukabuka kadi e? Nganunu ni Pawuli wufwa ha kulunsi mu dyambu dyeno e? Nganunu mu nkumbu yi Pawuli lubotokolo e?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Nakwe vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi bu nalembolo botika nakani muntu, tala ti ka Kilisipusi na Ngayusi ko. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Mu dyambu ti, kuu muntu ko lendi ta ti mu nkumbu ani lubotokolo. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Ninga, nabotika dyaka kanda di Sitefanasi, kansi nazebi muntu wuhiika wu nabotika ko. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Meno Klisto kamfidisa mu botika ko: wumfidisa mu samuna Musamu Wumbote, ka mu sadila ndwenga zi kimuntu ko, mwanki lulendo lu lufwa lu Klisto ha kulunsi lulembolo ba bonso kima kimpamba.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndwenga na bulahuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kedika, ndongosolo yi lufwa lu Klisto ha kulunsi yidi buzengi ku yobobo bana zimbala, kansi ku yeto tuu mu nzila yi mpulusu, tuna yena momo lulendo lu Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Wudi wusonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">«Nina zimbisa ndwenga zi bantu baa na ndwenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">mpe nina sukisa madyela ma bantu baa na madyela.»<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Muntu wundwenga kwedi kadi e? Mulongisi wu misiku kwedi kadi e? Nzonzi yi ntangu beyiyi yitomini zaba mu zonza kwedi yidi e? Nzambi wulonkidi ti ndwenga zi nza beyiyi ni bulahuki!<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Kedika, bantu na ndwenga zawu zimvimba, balembakani mu zaba dyaka Nzambi hoho ha kedi yenikisa ndwenga zandi. Ni hahoho Nzambi kabongila nzengolo ye vuukisa yobobo bana sa kiminu mu ndongosolo beyoyo yi bana yena ti yi bulahuki. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Bayudayo bana lomba bidimbu bingitukulu, na bangeleke bana sosa ndwenga, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />kansi yeto, tuna samuna Klisto wu bakoma ha kulunsi: wudi musamu wuna tesisa Bayudayo masakuba na bulahuki ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Kansi ku yobobo Nzambi bakatumisa, ni haba ti Bayudayo hoti yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, Klisto ni lulendo na ndwenga zi Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kedika, bulahuki bu Nzambi buhyokidi mu ndwenga na ndwenga zi bantu, na lebakani ku Nzambi kuvudi lulendo na ngolo zi bantu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Zimpangi, tomeeno yindula banani ludi yeno Nzambi ba katumisa: mu kimuntu, ha kati dyeno mwa ndambu yi bantu yii na ndwenga, mwa ndambu yii na lulendo, mwa ndambu yi bantu yii mu makanda ma buzitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Kansi, Nzambi wusoola myo mii mi bulahuki ha luse lu butoto, mu fwisa baa na ndwenga nsoni. Wusoola myo mii milebakana ha luse lu butoto, mu fwisa nsoni yobobo baa na ngolo. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Nzambi wusoola bima bilembolo ba na mfunu na byo bi bakwe yinanga, hoti bilembolo ba kisalu ha luse lu butoto mu mwangisa byo bi bakwe yenanga mfunu. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Ni hahoho, kuu muntu wumosi wulendi kitumpidika ha ntadisi yi Nzambi ko. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Kansi Nzambi wutuvuka kintwadi na Yesu-Klisto, na wusa ti Yesu kaba ndwenga zeto: Ni Klisto kwe tukitulanga balunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, na kwe sanga ti tuzinga mu dyambu di Nzambi, mpe kwe tukuulanga mu masumu. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Ni hahoho bonso buna ta masonama: «Tala ti muntu tiidi mu kisiikisa, kakisiikisa mu misamu mihidika Mfumu.»<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kusamuna Klisto wu bakoma ha kulunsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Mpangi zani, bu nayiza kuu yeno mu kwiza lusamunina mansweki ma mpulusu mayenikisa Nzambi, meno nazonzila mu mpova zingolo ko hoti nzayilu zingitukulu ko. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Mu dyambu ti, bu naba neeno, nasosa mu zaba musamu wuhiika, tala ti ka Yesu-Klisto kaka ko, wu bakoma ha kulunsi. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Ni hahoho, nakiyenikisa kuu yeno bonso muntu wulebakana, na kwe tekitanga mu bunkuta, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />ndongosolo zani na ndongolo zani ziba mu ndwenga zi bantu ko zikwe kwikisanga bantu mu tambula, kansi ni lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo lukwe yenikanga mu mi nakwe tanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Buna kiminu kyeno kisikamandi mu ndwenga zi bantu ko, kansi mu lulendo lu Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndwenga zi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Tukwe longanga ndwenga ku minsambidi mikula mu kimpeve, kansi ka ndwenga zi ntangu beyiyi ko hoti zi zimfumu zi ntangu beyiyi, zawu zaazimbala. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Nina samuna ndwenga zi mansweki ma Nzambi, zi kasweka ku bantu. Tekila nza yihilama, Nzambi za kakikubikila mu tukotisa mu nkembo andi. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Nakani wumosi mu zimfumu zi nza beyiyi zizaba ndwenga bezizi ko. Tala ti zabazaba, nganunu Mfumu yi nkembo bakoma ko. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Kansi bonso buna ta Masonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Momo malembolo yena meso, na malembolo yuwa makutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">momo malembolo yindula muntu mu mabanza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Nzambi makakubika ku yobobo bakwe mutyanga.<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nzambi kuu yeto kalonka myo mu Mpeve Yilongo. Mu dyambu ti, Mpeve yikwe fyongoninanga mimvimba, kaati myo midi mitoma swama mu Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Ha kati di bantu, nani zebi mabanza ma muntu, tala ti ka Mpeve ko yii mu kati di muntu e? Bumosi mpe, kunaani muntu wulenda zaba mabanza ma Nzambi, tala ti ka Mpeve yi Nzambi ko. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Yeto tutambula Mpeve yi nza beyiyi ko, kansi Mpeve yi tutambula, ni yikwe fumanga ku Nzambi, mwanki tuzaba minkayulu mi tuhaana Nzambi mu mulemvo andi. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Yeto tukwe zonzilanga mu mpova zikwe longanga ndwenga zi kimuntu ko, kansi mu ndwenga zikwe longanga Mpeve yi Nzambi. Bwabobo tukwe bangudilanga misamu mi kimpeve mu mpova zi kimpeve.<verse eid="1CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Yondowo kwe sikidilanga kaka mu ndwenga zandi zi kimuntu, kalendi tambula bima bikwe fumanga ku Mpeve yi Nzambi ko: ku yandi bo bulahuki budi, mpe kalendi bye bakula ko, mu dyambu ti ni mu kimpeve kwandi bakwe bakudilanga bo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Muntu wuu na Mpeve yi Nzambi, kwe bakulanga mimvimba. Kansi yandi, kunani muntu lendi mubakula. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Mu dyambu ti wusonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">«Nani zebi mabanza ma Mfumu e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">Nani lenda mu muhaana malongi e?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Kansi yeto, mabanza ma Klisto maa neto.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bisadi bi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Zimpangi, meno nalendidi mu luzonzila ko bonso bantu baa na Mpeve yi Nzambi, kansi bonso bantu baa ha nza, bonso baala bafyoti mu kiminu mu Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Naluheeni mamvumina, kansi ka bindya bikoba ko, mu dyambu ti luketi lenda mu kindila byo ko. Kaati mu ntangu beyiyi, lwalendeeno mu kindila byo ko, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />mu dyambu ti lwakidi bonso bantu ba nza beyiyi. Mpila mosi ti, lwakidi na musoki na mpaka ha kati dyeno, luna yena ko ti yeno lwakidi muntwadusulu yi bantu ba nza beyiyi, na luna dyatila mu ndyatulu yi kimuntu ko e? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Wumosi wuna ta ti: «Meno muntu wu Pawuli nidi», wuhiika ti: «Meno muntu wu Apolose nidi», luu kwandi bonso bantu bana dyatila mu kimuntu ko e?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Bwedi, Apolose nani kadi e? Na Pawuli nani kadi e? Bisadi binaani bi Nzambi tudi, bi kasadila mwanki lukwikila. Kadi muntu wuna sala kisalu kyandi bonso Mfumu kamuhaanina kyo. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Meno nakuna, Apolose wubondikila, kansi Nzambi kwandi kwe kudisanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Buna, yondowo wuna kuna na yondowo wuna bondikila, baa mfunu ko, kansi Nzambi kwandi kwe kudisanga wuu mfunu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Yondowo wuna kuna na yondowo wuna bondikila kidede badi. Nzambi mbo kahaana ku kadi muntu musendo andi bonso buu kisalu kyandi. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Mu dyambu ti, yeto tukwe salanga kintwadi na Nzambi. Yeno mfuba yi Nzambi ludi na nzo yitungu ku Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Bonso buu munkayulu wumpana Nzambi, meno natunga lufulu bonso kitungi kimbote. Bwabu, muntu wuhiika wuna tunga ha yulu lufulu. Kansi, bika kadi muntu kakikenga bonso bu kana tungila. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Mu dyambu ti kunaani muntu wulenda tunga lufulu luhiika, tala ti ka lo lutungu mu Yesu-Klisto ko. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Bahiika mbo batungila mu wola, palata hoti matadi mantalu. Bahiika mbo batungila mu bitungu, mu bititi hoti mu nyanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Kisalu ki kadi muntu kyaatoma yenika mu kilumbu ki mfundusu. Mu dyambu ti, kilumbu bekyokyo, tiya twaayenikisa kyo, mpe tiya twaalonkisa kisalu ki kadi muntu bonso bu kidi. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Tala ti kisalu kitunga muntu ha yulu lufulu, kihidi ku tiya ko, muntu wutunga kyo, waatambula musendo. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Kansi, tala ti kisalu kyandi kihidi ku tiya, yandi kaatambula musendo ko. Yandi bende waavulusu, kansi bonso muntu hyokidi mu milaka mi tiya.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Luzebi ko ti, yeno nzo-Nzambi ludi, mpe Mpeve yi Nzambi yikwe zakalanga mu kati dyeno e? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Tala ti muntu mwangisi nzo-Nzambi, Nzambi waamumwangisa. Mu dyambu ti nzo-Nzambi yilongo yidi, mpe, ni yeno luu nzo-Nzambi andi.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndwenga zikedika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Muntu kakihunandi yandi bende ko: tala ti wumosi mu yeno wuna banzila ti ndwenga zii nandi bonso buu nza beyiyi, bika kakituka kilahuki, mwanki kaba muntu wundwenga. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Mu dyambu ti ndwenga zi nza beyiyi ni bulahuki ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. Mu dyambu ti wusonama: «Nzambi kwe bakanga bantu mu mutambu mu madyela mawu mambi.» <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Wusonama dyaka ti: «Nzambi zebi mabanza ma bantu bandwenga, mpe zebi ti maa mfunu ko.» <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Ni hahoho, muntu kalendi kisiika mu bantu ko. Mu dyambu ti, bimvimba byeno bidi. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Pawuli, Apolose hoti Sefase, nza, luzingu, lufwa, ntangu beyiyi hoti ntangu yina kwiza, bimvimba byeno bidi. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Kansi yeno luvwihulu ku Klisto mpe Klisto vwihulu ku Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ntumwa zi Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Lufweti tubongilanga bonso bisadi bi Klisto mpe minkebi mi mansweki ma Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Kima ki bakwe lombanga ku minkebi, ni mu ba bakwikama. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Mu meno, ni nafundusu ku yeno hoti ku nzo yi lufundusu, minteedi ko. Mebende mpe nina kifundisa ko. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mu meno, nina yena kibila kye fundusulu ko, kansi kabwabobo ko buna sa ti naba muntu wulunungu. Yondowo wuna mfundisa, ni Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ni hahoho, lufundisangandi muntu ko tekila ntangu yilunga na tekila mvutukulu yi Mfumu. Mu dyambu ti, yandi waayenikisa misamu miswama ku nsye mpimpa na makani maswama ku nsye mitima. Buna kadi muntu waatambula masiika mandi mana fuma kuu Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Zimpangi, mu dyambu dyeno naluhaanini bifwani bebyobyo bitadidi Apolose na mebende, mwanki lubakula mu kifwani kyeto, nkinzi ye lembolo hyoka ndilu yi misamu mii misonama, mpe nakani muntu ka kitumpidikandi mu nwanina wumosi na mubedisa wuhiika. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Ngeye mu nki hyokidi bahiika e? Nki bii naaku bi wulembolo tambula e? Tala ti, kutambula wutambula byo, nki wuna kitumpidikila bonso ti wutambula byo ko e?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Bwabu lumeni baka bimvimba, lweka zimvwama! Lweka zintinu, kansi ka yeto ko! Ntiidi ti luba nkatika zintinu, mwanki yeto mpe tuyaala ha kimosi neeno! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ebu nina yenina: yeto zintumwa, Nzambi wutusa bantu ba kibuka kimanunu, bonso bantu babazengila kitumbu ki lufwa. Mu dyambu ti, batuyanika, mwanki nza, zimbazi na bantu ba tutalanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Yeto tuu bilahuki mu dyambu di Klisto, yeno bantu bandwenga mu Klisto, yeto tuu balebakana, kansi yeno ngolo zii neeno. Yeto bana tunyafuna, kansi yeno bana luzitisa! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Natee mu kilokola bekiki, tuna fwa nsatu na tuna yena mpwila yi mamba, mpene tudi na bana tuzuba bikoti, mpe tuna kwe yimingi, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />tuna yena mpasi mu sala mu moko meto. Bu bana tutuka, tuna sakumuna, bu bana tukwamisa, tuna vibidila, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />bu bana tutola, tuna bavutudila mvutu bumbote. Bana tubongila natee mu kilumbu bekiki ha luse lu butoto bonso dyala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dyala: ha kibuka bekyokyo ha bakwe loosanga bima bimbi</char></note>, na bonso bititi bilosidi bantu.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Nina sonikina misamu mimi, ka mu dyambu dye luyenisa nsoni ko, kansi mu lulwengisa bonso baala bani bantalu. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Mu dyambu ti, ni luba na mafunda kumi (10000) ma milongisi mi Klisto, luu na matata mamingi ko, mu dyambu ti ni meno naluhaana luzingu mu Yesu-Klisto mu ndongosolo yi Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ni hahoho nina lubombidila, landeeno kifwani kyani. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Musamu wawowo nina lutambikila Timote, mwana wu natomini tya na wuu wukwikama mu Mfumu. Yandi waalubambula moyo bwedi nina natina luzingu lwani mu Klisto, bonso bu nakwe kwe longingi mu bifulu bimvimba, mu Mabundu mamvimba.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Mwa ndambu ha kati dyeno bakitumpidikidi mu ta ti nabwesa kwiza lutala ko. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Kansi tala ti Nzambi tiidi, naakwiza kuu yeno. Ni hahoho, naabakudila kaka ko mabanza ma yobobo bana kitumpidika, kansi na lulendo lwawu. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Mu dyambu ti kimfumu ki Nzambi ka dyambu di zimpova ko, kansi dyambu di lulendo. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nki lutiidi e? Naluyizila na muhangu we luzubila, hoti niza na mutima wufuluka mu luzolo na mu lembami e?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kinsuza mu Dibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Bantu bana kwe zonzi mu bifulu bimvimba ti luna kwe sadidi kindumba ha kati dyeno, kindumba kihyokidi kitezo, kyo kilembolo ba ku bakwe lembolo kwikilanga! Mpe bantu bana kwe te ti wumosi mu yeno wuna kwe se kindumba na mukento wu tata andi! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Mpe luna kitumpidika! Wufweti toma luyenisa kyadi kikingi. Muntu wuhidikidi musamu wu bobobo, nganunu lumukumini ha kati dyeno. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Mu meno, mu kimuntu nii neeno kintwadi ko, kansi mu mpeve nii neeno, mpe nameni fundisa yondowo wuhidikidi musamu wubobo, bonso ti nii kwa neeno kintwadi. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Bu lwaakutakana, mu nkumbu yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, naaba neeno kintwadi mu mpeve na mu lulendo lu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Muntu bewowo lufweti muyekola ku Satana, mwanki nsuni andi yifukila, mpe mpeve andi yivuuka mu kilumbu ki Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ka wuu musamu we kitumpidika ko! walutomini zaba ti: «Mwa kima kikwe vimbisanga kiputi kivimbisi kiputi kimvimba ki mampa.» <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Seeno ti luba bavedila mu katula kima kinkulu kikwe vimbisanga kiputi ki mampa, mwanki kikituka kiputi kimoona, mu dyambu ti lusiidi na kima kikwe vimbisanga kiputi ki mampa ko. Kadi Klisto ni dimeme dyeto di Pake di bahaana bonso munkayulu. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Ni hahoho, tukembileeno mukembo wu Pake, ka na mampa maa na kima kinkulu kikwe vimbisanga kiputi ko, kima ki misamu mimbi na mimbalu, kansi na mampa malembolo ba na kima kikwe vimbisanga kiputi ki mampa, ni mu ba wuvedila na kikedika.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Mu mukanda ani wutekila, nalusonikina mu lembolo ba kintwadi na yobobo bakwe sadilanga kindumba. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Nazonzila bantu bamvimba bakwe sadilanga kindumba mu nza beyiyi ko, yobobo baa na nzinunu, bamivi, hoti bakwe sambilanga biteki. Tala ti kabobo ko, nganunu luketi totoka mu nza beyiyi. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Kansi nalusonikini ti lubandi kintwadi na muntu wuna kibika ti mu Klisto kadi, kansi wuna sadila kindumba, nzinunu, kusambila biteki, kutola bantu, kinkolo mbungu hoti mwivi. Muntu wubobo lulendi dya ha kimosi nandi ko.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Kadi ni meno mfweti fundisa bantu balembolo ba kintwadi na Klisto e? Ka ni bantu baa mu dibundu dyeno ko lufweni fundisa e? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Mpe yobobo baa ku mbazi, Nzambi waabafundisa, mu dyambu ti wusonama: «Kumeeno ha kati dyeno muntu wumbalu.»<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mfundusu ha kati di zimpangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Tala ti wumosi mu yeno bakani na munandi, bwedi kalendi kwe mufundila ku bantu balembolo zaba Nzambi ha kibuka kye kwe mufunda ku balongo e? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Yeno luzebi ko ti balongo baafundisa nza e? Mpe tala ti ni mu yeno nza beyiyi yaafundusulu, bwedi luna lembinina kweno mu haana nzengolo mu mwa misamu mi fyoti-fyoti e? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Yeno luzebi ko ti yeto twaafundisa zimbazi e? Buna tulendi fundisa misamu mi luzingu belulu! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Bu lukwe banga na mbakani mu misamu mitadidi luzingu, mimfundisi mi lukwe bonganga, ni bantu bebobo dibundu kakwe yenanga ti bantu bampamba badi! <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nina zonzila bobo mu luyenisa nsoni. Bwedi, ha naani muntu wumosi wu ndwenga ha kati dyeno wulendi haana nzengolo ha kati di zimpangi zandi ko e? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Kansi bila nki mpangi kalendi fundisila mpangi nandi ha ntadisi yi balembolo ba minkwidi e?<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Wukedika musamu wumbi wudi, bu lukwe fundasananga yeno na yeno. Bila nki lukwe lembolo vibidilanga bu bakwe luhidikanga misamu milembolo fwanakana e? Bila nki lukwe lembolo tambudilanga ti baluzyona kima e? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Kansi ni yeno lukwe hidikanga misamu milembolo fwanakana na lukwe zyonanga bima bi bahiika, mpe ku zimpangi zeno lukwe mye hidikanga! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Yeno luzebi ko ti bantu balembolo ba balunungu baabyadila fwa di kimfumu ki Nzambi ko e? Ka lukihunandi ko: yobobo bakwe sadilanga kindumba, bakwe sambilanga biteki, na bakwe sadilanga kinsuza, na babakala bakwe vukisanga nitu zawu yawu na yawu, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />bamivi, bantu baa na nzinunu, minkolo mbungu, ba nga matoola, bakwe zyonanga bima bi banawu, baatambula fwa di kimfumu ki Nzambi ko. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Ni bwabobo mpe yeno bahiika luba ha kati dyeno. Kansi yeno baluvedisa, balusa ti luba bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na balusa bantu balunungu mu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu-Klisto na mu Mpeve yi Nzambi eto.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukembisa Nzambi mu nitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Lukwe tanga ti: «Nii na luve mu hidika misamu mimvimba!» Kansi mimvimba mii mfunu ko. «Nii na luve mu hidika misamu mimvimba», kansi naatambula muba ku nsye lutumu lu kani kima ko. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />lukwe tanga dyaka ti: «Bindya bidi mu dyambu di moyo, na moyo mu dyambu di bindya», mpe Nzambi mbo kafukisa bya bibyole. Kansi nitu ka yihiduku mu dyambu di kindumba ko, yihiduku mu dyambu di Mfumu na Mfumu wudi mu dyambu di nitu. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nzambi wufulukisa Mfumu mu bafwa, waatufulukisa yeto mpe mu bafwa mu lulendo lwandi.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Luzebi ko ti nitu zeno binama bi Klisto bidi e? Bwedi naabongila binama bi Klisto mu kitula byo binama mu sadila kindumba e? Kuba mpe! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Luzebi ko ti yondowo vukani na nsuza weka nandi nitu yimosi e? Wusonama ti: «Yababole baaba nitu yimosi.» <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Kansi yondowo siidi kintwadi na Mfumu, weka mpeve yimosi nandi.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Tineeno kindumba! Masumu mamvimba malendi hidika muntu, madi mu kati di nitu andi ko, kansi yondowo sidi kindumba sumuni nitu yi yandi bende. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Yeno luzebi ko ti nitu eno nzo yi Mpeve Yilongo yidi e? Mpeve beyoyo ni Mpeve yiluhaana Nzambi. Lukivwidi yebende ko, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />mu dyambu ti Nzambi wulusumba mu ntalu yiyingi. Buna kembisangeeno Nzambi mu nitu eno.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mvutu mu dyambu di makwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Mu misamu mi lunsonikini, bumbote ti bakala kalembolo kwela mukento. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Kansi mu lembolo sadila kindumba, bika kadi bakala kaba na mukento andi, mpe kadi mukento kaba na bakala andi. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Bika bakala kalungisa nsatu zi mukento andi, bumosi mpe mukento, fweti lungisa nsatu zi bakala andi. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Mukento kaa mfumu yi nitu andi ko, kansi ni bakala andi. Bumosi mpe, bakala kaa mfumu yi nitu andi ko, kansi ni mukento andi. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Lubisandi mu kabasana nitu, tala ti lutekidi yuwasana ha kimosi ko mu lukiyekola mwa ntangu yifyoti mu minunu yi nsoki na mu lusambulu. Ku manima mbo lubwesa vukana, mwanki Satana kalembolo lutonta, tala ti luyedi nitu zeno.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Nina zonzila bobo ka mu luhaana misiku ko, kansi mabanza kwandi nina luhaana. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Natiidi ti bamvimba baba bonso bu nidi meno, kansi kadi muntu wutambula munkayulu ku Nzambi, wumosi tambudi munkayulu wu ebu, wuhiika tambudi munkayulu wu buhiika.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Ebu nina ta ku yobobo balembolo ba bakwela na ku bamafoola, buu bumbote ku yawu muba bonso bu nidi meno. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Kansi tala ti balendi kukiyaala ko, bika bakwela, buvudidi bumbote mu yawu mu kwela na muba na mitima mi nalungula mu nsatu zi nsuni.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Ku yobobo baa bakwela, ntumunu eyi na luheeni, yifumini ku meno ko kansi ku Mfumu: Mukento kahambanandi na bakala dyandi ko, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />- tala ti hambani na bakala dyandi, ka bwesandi kwela hoti ka wawasana na bakala dyandi - mpe bakala kahambanandi na mukento andi.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Ebu nina ta ku bahiika (mebende nina ta bo, kansi ka Mfumu ko): tala ti mpangi yi mu Klisto yimosi wuu na mukento wulembolo ba munkwikidi, mpe ti mukento tambudi mu zakala nzo yimosi nandi, kabika mu hambana nandi. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Bumosi mpe, tala ti mukento wuu na bakala di lembolo ba munkwikidi, mpe bakala tambudi mu zakala nzo yimosi nandi, kabika mu hambana nandi. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Mu dyambu ti, bakala di lembolo ba munkwikidi waaba muntu wu vwihulu ku Nzambi mu dyambu di mukento andi, bumosi mpe ku mukento wulembolo ba munkwikidi waaba muntu wu vwihulu ku Nzambi mu dyambu di bakala dyandi. Tala ti ka bwabobo ko, baala beno baketi ba bavedila ko, mpeleko balongo badi. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Tala ti yondowo lembolo ba munkwikidi tiidi mu hambana, ka hambana kwandi. Munkwikidi, wu bakala hoti wu mukento ka wukangama mu musamu bewowo ko, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wulutumisa mu zinga mu kiyenge. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Ngeye mukento bwedi lendi zabila ti waavuukisa bakala dyaku e? Hoti ngeye bakala bwedi lendi zabila ti waavuukisa mukento aku e?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuzinga bonso bu tutumisina Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Dyambu dihiika edi, bika kadi muntu katatamana mu zinga bonso buu munkayulu wu muhaana Mfumu, mpe bonso bu kaba mu ntangu Nzambi yi kamutumisa. Yoyoyo ni ntumunu yi nina haana ku mabundu mamvimba. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Tala ti ku na muntu wuba wuzengoso bubakala mu ntangu Nzambi yikamutumisa, ka sosandi mu sweka ko. Tala ti muntu wuba wulembolo zengoso bubakala mu ntangu Nzambi yikamutumisa, kabika mu zengoso bubakala. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kuzengoso na kulembolo zengoso bubakala kuu mfunu ko, kansi dyambu dii mfunu, ni kuntumama mu mina mi Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Bika kadi muntu katatamana mu zinga bonso bu kaba mu ntangu Nzambi yi kamutumisa. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Kadi mundongo wuba mu ntangu Nzambi yi kakutumisa e? Kunyonginandi wo ko, kansi tala ti beki hwahwa mu ba kimpwanza, landa nzila beyoyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Mu dyambu ti, mundongo Mfumu wu katumisa, wuhika kimpwanza mu Mfumu, bumosi mpe, muntu wuu kimpwanza Mfumu wu katumisa wudi mundongo wu Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Nzambi wulukuula mu ntalu yiyingi, lubandi mindongo mi bantu ko. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Zimpangi, bika kadi muntu katatamana mu zinga bonso bu kaba mu ntangu Nzambi yi kamutumisa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyuhu mu dyambu di bantu balembolo ba bakwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Ku bantu balembolo ba bakwela, nii na ntumunu yi Mfumu ko, kansi mabanza kwandi nina luhaana bonso muntu wu bafweti siila kivuvu, muntu wutambudi mulemvo ku Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Nina banza ti, mu dyambu di mpasi zi ntangu beyiyi, bumbote ti: muntu kaba kwandi bonso bu kadi. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Mukento wuu naku e? Kusosandi mu hambana nandi ko. Wudi aku na mukento ko e? Kusosandi mu ba na mukento. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Tala ti kwedidi, siidi masumu ko, mpe tala ti ndumba yikwedidi, kasiidi masumu ko. Kansi, bantu baa bakwela, baakwamusu mu luzingu lwawu, mpe ntiidi ti lulembolo yena mpasi bezozo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Zimpangi, ebu nina ta: ntangu yeka lukufi. Bwabu, bika babakala baa na bakento baba bonso ti baa na bakento ko, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />yobobo bana dila baba bonso ti bana dila ko, yobobo bana yangalala baba bonso ti bana yangalala ko, yobobo bana sumba baba bonso ti baa na kima ko, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />na yobobo bana sadila bima bi nza beyiyi baba bonso ti bana sadila byo ko. Mu dyambu ti, nza beyiyi bonso bu yidi, yaahyoka.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Meno ntiidi ti lulembolo kikwamisa. Yondowo lembolo ba wukwela katuula mayindu mandi mu misamu mi Mfumu, kasosa bwedi kalendi yangidikila Mfumu, <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />kansi, bakala bedyodyo dii dikwela, kwe sanga mayindu mandi mu misamu mi nza beyiyi, kwe sosanga bwedi kalendi yangidikila mukento andi. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Mpe diswasani dihoho ha kati di mukento wulembolo kwela na ndumba: yawu balembolo ba bakwela, bakwe sanga mayindu mawu mu misamu mi Mfumu, mwanki baba balongo mu nitu na mu mpeve, kansi mukento wuu wukwela, kwe sanga mayindu mandi mu misamu mi nza beyiyi, kwe sosanga bwedi kalendi yangidikila bakala dyandi.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Nina zonzila bobo mu dyambu di bumbote bweno, kansi ka mu lukwikisa ko, ntiidi ti luhidika misamu mifwanakani, mu ba bakangama mvimba mu kisalu ki Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Tala ti toko dina yena ti bumbi kana sa mu lembolo kwela ndumba yi bawawasani makwela, tala ti nsatu zina muyaala, mpe wuna yena ti bumbote bakwelana, bika bakwelana kwawu, bonso bu katiidi, bana sa masumu ko. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Kansi, tala ti toko bongidi nzengolo ku nsye mutima andi, wulembolo kwikusu, mu lembolo kwela. Tala ti wuu na lulendo lwe yaala nsatu zandi, mpe bongidi nzengolo yandi bende mu lembolo vuka mfulu na ndumba yi bawawasani makwela, musamu wumbote kahidikidi. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Buna, yondowo kwedidi ndumba andi yi bawawasani makwela, musamu wumbote kahidikidi. Kansi, yondowo bisidi mu kwela hidikidi musamu wuvudidi bumbote.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mukento wuu wukangama ku mulumi andi ntangu zimvimba bu kakidi wumoyo. Kansi, tala ti mulumi andi fwidi, beki kimpwanza mu kwela wonso wu katiidi, mpasi bakala bedyodyo diba dikangama mu Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Kansi, mu mayindu mani, yandi wavula ba mu kyese tala ti bedi kwandi bobo. Meno mpe nina banza ti, Mpeve yi Nzambi yii naani.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mbizi zi baheeni bonso minkayulu ku nzambi zi biteki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Mu dyambu ditadidi mbizi zi bakwe haananga ku nzambi zi biteki bonso minkayulu, tuzebi ti yeto bamvimba tuu na nzayilu. Nzayilu zikwe sanga ti muntu kaba na mayama, kansi luzolo lukwe tunganga. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Tala ti muntu wuna banza ti mwa kima kazebi, wakidi wulembolo zaba nakani kima bonso bufwanakani. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Kansi muntu ti tiidi Nzambi, Nzambi wumuzebi.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ni hahoho, mu dyambu ditadidi kudya mbizi zi baheeni bonso minkayulu ku nzambi zi biteki, tuzebi ti nzambi zi biteki bima bi mpamba bidi mu nza, mpe Nzambi yimosi kwandi yidi. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Mu dyambu ti wukedika, kuu na byo bi bakwe tumisinanga ti zinzambi, ni kuba ku yulu, ni haba ha luse lu butoto, mpe wudi wukedika ti zinzambi na zimfumu zizingi zidi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />kansi mu yeto, Nzambi yimosi kaka yidi, yandi wudi Tata, na ku yandi bima bimvimba bikwe fumanga, mpe mu dyambu dyandi tudi bamoyo. Mpe Mfumu yimosi kwandi yidi, ni Yesu-Klisto, mu yandi bima bimvimba bikwe zinganga, na mu yandi tudi bamoyo.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Kansi, bamvimba baa na nzayilu beyoyo ko. Ndambu yi bantu bahiika batoma yuku na nzambi zi biteki, bakwe dyanga mbizi zi minkayulu, bonso ti zivwihulu ku nzambi zi biteki, mayindu mawu malebakana madi, mpe bakwe banzilanga ti mbizi beyoyo yikwe basumunanga. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Kansi ka bindya ko bikwe tusanga ti tuba bela-bela na Nzambi: Tala ti tudidi byo, hanaani kima kyaabwesama. Tala ti tudidi byo ko, hanaani mpe kima kyaakatuka.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Kayeeno meso kadi ntangu, mwanki kimpwanza kyeno ki lembolo ba ntesoso yi masakuba ku bantu balembolo ba na kiminu kisyama. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Tala ti muntu wulembolo ba na kiminu kisyama wukuyeni ngeye wuu na «nzayilu», wuna dya ha meza mu nzo yi nzambi zi biteki, nganunu kaabaka nsyamusu ko mu mayindu mandi, mu dya mbizi bezozo zi bakwe hananga minkayulu ku nzambi zi biteki e? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ni hahoho, mpangi beyoyo yifwila Klisto, yilembolo ba na kiminu kisyamana, yaazimbala mu dyambu di nzayilu aku! <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Bu luna hola masumu ku mpangi zeno, mpe bu luna fyetikisa mayindu mawu malebakana, ni ha ntadisi yi Klisto luna hola masumu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ni hahoho, tala ti bindya bina tesisa mpangi ani masakuba, naabwesa dya mbizi ko, mwanki na lembolo tesisa mpangi ani masakuba.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Bwedi Pawuli kasamunina Musamu Wumbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Bwedi nii kimpwanza ko e? Nii ntumwa ko e? Nayena Yesu-Klisto Mfumu eto ko e? Yeno ludi ndandu yi kisalu kyani mu Mfumu ko e? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Tala ti bahiika bana bisa ti meno ntumwa nidi, kansi mwanki kuu yeno ntumwa nidi, mu dyambu ti yeno kimbangi kyani kina lonka kisalu kyani ki kintumwa mu Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Mvutu ani ku yobobo bana mfundanga, ni eyi: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Bwedi, tuu na luve mudya na munwa mu kisalu kyeto ko e? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Bwedi, tuu na luve ko mu nata mu nzyetolo mpangi yi mukento muklisto, yaaba bonso mukazi eto, bonso bukwe sanga zintumwa zihiika, na zimpangi zi Mfumu na Sefase e? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Bwedi, yeto kwandi, Banabase na meno, tu lembolo ba na luve mu lembolo sala mu baka bye dya e? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Nani kwe salanga kisalu ki kimbulu-mbulu nakwe kifutanga yandi bende e? Nani kwe salanga mfuba yi vinu nakwe lembolo dya mbutu e? Nani kwe kenganga kamba di bibulu nakwe lembolo nwa mamvumina ma bibulu e?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Kadi mu kimuntu kwandi nina teela musamu bewuwu e? Misiku mina ta bo ko e? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Mu dyambu ti wuu wusonama mu misiku mi Mose ti: «kukangandi munwa wu ngombe yina kwe dyati mbutu mwanki zi keloka.» Bwedi luna banzila ti Nzambi kwe kikwamisanga mu dyambu di zingombe e? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Ka mu dyambu dyeto ko kazonzila bobo e? Ninga, mu dyambu dyeto basonikina musamu bewuwu. Bika yondowo wuna fundumunu butoto na yondowo wuna tuta bele (mu hambula mbutu na bititi) basala na kivuvu kye baka kikunku kyawu ki nyonzokolo. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Tala ti yeto tukuna mbutu zi kimpeve ha kati dyeno, kadi musamu wuwunene wudi mu tambula ndambu bima mu bimvwama byeno e? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Tala ti bantu bahiika baa na luve mu bonga bima ku yeno, yeto tuvudidi mu ba na luve lwe bonga bima ku yeno e?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Kansi yeto tusadila luve belolo ko. Tukwe vibidilanga mimvimba mwanki tulembolo sa kikaku mu Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Yeno luzebi ko ti bantu bakwe salanga mu kati di nzo-Nzambi, mu nzo-Nzambi mpe bakwe diilanga, mpe yobobo bakwe salanga ha ziku di bakwe yokilanga minkayulu, kikunku kyawu ha ziku bakwe bakilanga kyo e? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Bumosi mpe, Mfumu wuhaana ntumunu ku yobobo bakwe samunanga Musamu Wumbote ba bakilanga bindya mu Musamu Wumbote.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Kansi meno, nalombidi nakani kima kii naani luve mu sadila ko, mpe nsonikini musamu bewuwu ko, mwanki lumpidikila bo, mu dyambu ti buvudidi bumbote bu nafwidi kwani na bu bankatudi musamu bewuwu we sila mayama. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ndendi kitumpidika ko, bu nina samuna Musamu Wumbote. Mu dyambu ti kisalu bekiki kukwika bansa kyo. Kyadi kuu meno tala ti nina samuna Musamu Wumbote ko! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Tala ti mu mutima wumosi nina sadila kyo, buna naatambula musendo, kansi tala ti nina sadila kyo mu kukwikisa, buna kyeka kizitu bantwikidi. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Buna bwabu mufutu ani ni nki e? Ni kyese kye samuna mumpamba Musamu Wumbote, wulembolo sadila luve lwani mu baka bima bu nina samuna Musamu Wumbote bewowo.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Kimpwanza nidi, mpe nii mundongo wu muntu ko, kansi nakisiidi mundongo wu bantu bamvimba, mwanki natoma baka bantu babingi mu Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ha kati di Bayudayo, naba bonso Muyudayo, mwanki nabaka Bayudayo. Ha kati di yobobo baa ku nsye misiku mi Mose naba bonso muntu wuu ku nsye misiku, mpeleko mebende nii ku nsye misiku ko, mwanki nabaka yobobo baa ku nsye misiku. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Bumosi mpe, ha kati di yobobo balembolo ba ku nsye misiku, bonso yawu, naba ti nii na misiku bemyomyo ko, mwanki nabaka yobobo balembolo baa ku nsye misiku. Bu nata ko ti, nakwe tumiminanga misiku mi Nzambi ko, mu dyambu ti meno mpe nii ku nsye misiku mi Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Ha kati di yobobo baa balebakana mu kiminu, naba bonso muntu wulebakana, mwanki nabaka balebakana. Nahidika misamu mimvimba mifwanakani na bantu bamvimba, mwanki navuukisa mwa ndambu yi bantu. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Mpe nakwe hidikanga misamu mimvimba bemyomyo, mu dyambu di Musamu Wumbote, mwanki nabaka musendo wu bansila nsilulu.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunooka ku baa mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Yeno luzebi ko ti yobobo bakwe nookanga ntiinu ha kibuka ki bakwe nookinanga ntiinu, yawu bamvimba bakwe nookanga, kansi wumosi kwandi kwe nunganga. Nookeeno mwanki lununga. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Yobobo bamvimba bakwe nookanga ntiinu, nzengolo bakwe bonganga mu lembolo bwesa hidika misamu mihiika. Bakwe silanga bobo, mwanki babaka mpu yi nungunu yikwe bebanga (bihanga), kansi yeto tunookeeno mu baka mpu yi nungunu yikwe lembolo bebanga (bihanga). <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Ni hahoho, meno nkwe nookanga bonso-bonso ko, nii bonso kinwani mu nkome, mpe nkwe windanga nkome honso-honso ko. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Kansi, nitu ani ya nkwe toma yenisanga mpasi, mpe ya nkwe yaalanga, mwanki mebende nalembolo hungulu bu namanisi mu samuna Musamu Wumbote ku bahiika.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ndwengoso mu nzambi zi biteki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Zimpangi, natiidi lubambuka moyo, mu myo mi bwabwana zinkaka zeto mu ntangu yi Mose. Yawu bamvimba baba ku nsye lukengolo lu tuti, mpe bamvimba basabuka mubu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Bamvimba babotoko mu Mose mu tuti na mu mubu, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />bamvimba badya bindya bi kimpeve bi mutindu wumosi <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />mpe bamvimba banwa mamba ma kimpeve ma mutindu wumosi. Mu dyambu ti banwa mu tadi di kimpeve dyedi kwe yendingi nawu ha kimosi, mpe tadi bedyodyo diba ni Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Kansi babingi ha kati dyawu, baba bazolakana ku Nzambi ko, ni hahoho bafwila mu nsi yinkatu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Misamu bemyomyo mi hidimina mwanki miba kifwani ku yeto, mpe tulembolo ba na nzinunu bonso ziba na zinkaka zeto. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Lukitukandi minsambidi mi nzambi zi biteki ko bonso bahiika ha kati dyawu. Mu dyambu wusonama ti: «Mukangu wuzakala mu dya na mu nwa, mpe wutelama mu sakana.» <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Tusadilandi kindumba ko bonso busa bahiika ha kati dyawu, mpe mafunda makumole na tatu (23000) ma bantu mafwa mu kilumbu kimosi. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Tutontandi Klisto ko bonso busa bahiika ha kati dyawu, mpe bafwa nyoka bu zibata. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Luvungutandi ko bonso busa bahiika ha kati dyawu, mpe mbazi yi lufwa yi bafukisa.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Mpasi bezozo zi batudila mu lonka kifwani ku bahiika, mpe basonika myo mu tulwengisa, mu dyambu ti tuna zinga mu ntangu yi nsukunu. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ni hahoho, yondowo wuna banza ti wutelama kadi, kakeba kwandi mu lembolo bwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ku naani ntontolo zilubwididi zikwe lembolo bwidilanga bantu. Nzambi wukwikama kadi, mpe kaahaana luve ko ti ntontolo zihyoka ngolo zeno, kansi mu ntangu yi ntontolo, waalukubikila nzila yi lwaadukila, mwanki lulenda mu vibidila zo.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi zani zizola, tineeno mu sambila zinzambi zi biteki. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nina luzonzila bonso bantu baa na madyela, fyongonineeno yebende mi nina ta. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Mbungu yi lusakumunu yi tukwe sakumunanga, yii kintwadi na menga ma Klisto ko e? Dimpa di tukwe bukunanga, dii kintwadi na nitu yi Klisto ko e? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Dimpa dimosi kwandi didi, yeto bamvimba nitu yimosi kwandi tudi, mu dyambu ti dimpa dimosi kwandi tukwe dyanga.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Taleeno ba-Isaeli: Yobobo bakwe dyanga bibulu bi baheeni bonso minkayulu, baa kintwadi ko na Nzambi wu bakwe yokilanga munkayulu ha ziku e? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Nki nalendi ta e? Mbizi yi baheeni munkayulu ku nzambi zi biteki mfunu yidi, hoti nzambi yi kiteki mfunu yidi e? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Kaani, ebu nina ta: bima bikwe haananga balembolo ba Bayudayo mu minkayulu mye yoka, ku mpeve zimbi bakwe bye haananga, kansi ka kuu Nzambi ko. Ntiidi ko ti luba kintwadi na mpeve zimbi. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Yeno lulendi nwa ha kimosi ko mbungu yi Mfumu na mbungu yi mpeve zimbi, mpe lulendi dya ha kimosi ha meza ma Mfumu na ha meza ma mpeve zimbi ko. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Hoti, yeto tutiidi mu sa ti Mfumu kaba na kimpala mu yeto e? Nganunu yeto tuvudi ngolo na yandi e?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusala mu dyambu di nkembo yi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />«[Nii] na luve mu hidika misamu mimvimba!» Kansi mimvimba mii mfunu ko. «[Nii] na luve mu hidika misamu mimvimba», kansi mimvimba mikwe tunganga ko. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Muntu kasosandi ndandu yi yandi bende ko, kansi kasosa ndandu yi wuhiika.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Dyeeno bima bimvimba bi bakwe yadikanga ha zandu, kansi lukifulandi kyuhu kilendi fyetikisa mabanza meno, <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />mu dyambu ti wusonama: «Butoto na bima bimvimba bii ha butoto bivwihulu ku Mfumu.»<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Tala ti muntu lembolo ba munkwikidi wulutumisi ku ndambisa, mpe tala ti lutambudi mu kwenda, dyeeno bimvimba bi bana luhaana, kansi lufulandi kyuhu mu lembolo fyetikisa mabanza meno. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Kansi tala ti muntu wulutedidi ti: «Mbizi beyiyi mbizi yi haanu ku nzambi zi biteki yidi», ludyandi ko mu dyambu di yondowo wulutedidi musamu na mu dyambu di mabanza meno. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Nina zonzila mabanza maku eha ko, kansi ma muntu wuhiika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">«Bila nki, kimpwanza kyani kyafundusu ku mabanza ma muntu wuhiika e? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Tala ti nina vutula matondo ku Nzambi mu byo bi nina dya, bila nki luna mvwezila mu bindya bi mvutudidi matondo e?»<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ni hahoho, ni ludya, ni lunwa hoti kima ni kima ki luna sa, seeno mimvimba mu kembisa Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Lubandi bantu bakwe tesisanga masakuba ku Bayudayo, ku Bangeleke, mpe ku Dibundu di Nzambi ko. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Dyatileeno bonso meno: nina sa ngolo mu yangidika bamvimba mu bima bimvimba, nakwe sosanga mambote ma mebende ko, kansi mambote ma bantu babingi, mwanki bavuuka.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Landeeno kifwani kyani, bonso mebende nkwe landanga kifwani ki Klisto.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukento na bakala mu ntangu ye sambila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nina lusiika mu mimvimba mu dyambu ti lukwe mbambukilanga moyo kadi ntangu na lukwe kebanga ndongosolo bonso bu naluhaanina zo. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ntiidi lubakula musamu ewu: Klisto ni Mfumu yi kadi bakala, bakala wuu mfumu yi mukento, mpe Nzambi wuu Mfumu yi Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Dyonso bakala dikwe sambilanga hoti dikwe bikulanga na mutu wufuku, dikwe zitisanga mfumu andi. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Kansi wonso mukento wuna sambila hoti wuna bikula na mutu wulembolo fuku kana zitisa mfumu andi ko. Mu dyambu ti, mfwanakani bonso mukento wu basidi kungulu ku mutu. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Tala ti mukento kaa na mutu wufuku ko, bamuhempa kungulu. Mpe, tala ti nsoni zidi ku mukento mu ba na milengi mizengo, hoti na kungulu, bika kafuka mutu andi. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Bakala kalendi fuka mutu ko, mu dyambu ti yandi kifwani mpe nkembo yi Nzambi kadi. Kansi, mukento nkembo yi wubakala kadi. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Mu dyambu ti, bakala kafuma mu mukento ko, kansi mukento wufuma mu bakala. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Mpe ka bakala ko bahidika mu dyambu di mukento, kansi mukento bahidika mu dyambu di bakala. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ni hahoho, mukento fweti fuka mutu andi mu lonka ti wuu ku nsye lutumu na mu dyambu di zimbazi. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Kansi mu kizingu kyeto mu Mfumu, mukento kalendi ba wulembolo bakala ko, mpe bakala kalendi ba wulembolo mukento ko. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Mu dyambu ti, bonso bufumina mukento mu bakala, bwabobo mpe, bakala dibutukila mu mukento, na mimvimba mikwe fumanga kuu Nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Taleeno yebende: budi bumbote ku mukento kasambila Nzambi na mutu wulembolo fuku e? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nganunu, nza yabende yina lulonga ko ti nsoni zidi ku bakala muba na milengi mimila e? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Kansi, yidi nkembo ku mukento muba na milengi mimila. Mu dyambu ti, bamuhaana milengi mimila mu fukanga mutu andi bonso kitambala. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Tala ti muntu wuna tya mu lubindisa mpaka mu musamu bewuwu, kazaba ti: mu Mabundu ma Nzambi na yeto bende mpe, tuu na kifu bekyokyo ko.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bindya bi Mfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat 26.26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mlk 14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22.15-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Mu misamu mina landa, nina lusiika ko, mu dyambu ti, bu lukwe vukananga lukwe vula hidikanga misamu mimbi, kansi ka mimbote ko. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ntete-ntete, nina yuwanga ti, bu lukwe vukananga nkabani zikwe banga neeno, mpe nakwe kwikilanga fyoti. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Wukedika, ha kati dyeno ha fweti banga na nkabani, mwanki minsambidi mikedika mi ba mizabakana ha kati dyeno. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Bu lukwe kutakananga, nina yena ti ka bindya bi Mfumu ko lukwe dyanga, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />mu dyambu ti, bu lukwe zakalanga ha meza, kadi muntu kwe bingilanga mu bonga bindya bi yandi bende. Ni hahoho lukwe belanga ti, wumosi wuu na nsatu, kansi wuhiika wuna kolo. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Kadi, luu na zinzo mu dya na mu nwa ko e? Hoti, Dibundu di Nzambi luna vweza, mpe lutiidi mu fwisa nsoni yobobo balembolo ba na kima e? Nki nalendi luteela e? Nganunu lutiidi na lusiika e? Mu musamu bewuwu, nina lusiika ko.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Kadi ndongosolo yi nina lulonga, ku Mfumu natambula yo: Mfumu Yesu, mu mpimpa beyoyo yi bamukanga, wubonga dimpa, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />bu kamana vutula matondo, wubukuna dyo na wuta ti: «Bongeeno na dyeeno, yi ni nitu ani yihaanu mu dyambu dyeno. Sangeeno bobo mu mbambukilanga moyo.» <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Wusa bumosi mpe na mbungu, bu bamana dya, wuta ti: «Mbungu beyiyi ni luwawanu lumoona mu menga mani ma ba tengola mu dyambu dyeno. Sangeeno bobo mu mbambukilanga moyo ntangu zimvimba zi luna nwa yo.» <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Mu dyambu ti, ntangu zimvimba zi luna dya dimpa bedidi na zi luna nwa mbungu beyiyi, luna samuna lufwa lu Mfumu natee bu kana kwiza.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ni hahoho, yondowo wuna dya dimpa bedyodyo hoti wuna nwa mbungu yi Mfumu na mbeelo yilembolo lunga, waasa disumu ha ntadisi yi nitu na menga ma Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Ni hahoho, bika kadi muntu kakifyongonina, teekila kadya dimpa na kanwa mbungu, <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />kadi yondowo wuna dya na wuna nwa wulembolo zaba ti yiyiyi ni nitu yi Mfumu, wuna dya na wuna nwa mfundusu mu yandi bende. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ni hahoho, babingi ha kati dyeno baa na byeta na bimbevo, mpe babingi bafwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Tala ti tukifyongonini yeto bende, baatufundisa ko. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Kansi, bu tukwe fundusungu, Mfumu kwe tusembanga mwanki tulembolo fundusu ha kimosi na bantu ba nza.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Buna zimpangi zani, bu lukwe kutakananga mu dya, kingangeeno bahiika. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Tala ti muntu wuu na nsatu, kateka saa dya ku nzo andi, mwanki lukutukunu lweno lulembolo lunatina mfundusu yeno. Mu byuhu bihiika, mbo nahaanina byo mvutu bu naakwiza kuu yeno.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Minkayilu mi Mpeve Yilongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Mpangi zani, mu myo mitadidi misamu mi kimpeve, natiidi ko luba ku nsye bunzimbu. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Lutomini zaba ti, buna lwabedi minkwikidi ko, luba ku nsye luntwadusulu yi zinzambi zi biteki zikwe lembolo zonzanga. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Ni hahoho nina we luteela ti: kuu muntu ko wuna twadusu ku Mpeve yi Nzambi lendi ta ti: «Yesu wusingu kadi!» Mpe kuu muntu ko lendi ta ti: «Yesu Mfumu kadi!» Tala ti kana twadusu ku Mpeve Yilongo ko.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Minkayulu miswasana midi, kansi Mpeve yimosi kwandi yikwe haananga myo. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Bisalu bibingi bidi, kansi Mfumu yimosi kwandi tukwe sadilanga. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Nsadulu zizingi zidi, kansi Nzambi yayoyo kwandi yikwe salanga ku bamvimba mu mimvimba. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Kansi, kadi muntu wutambula munkayulu wu Mpeve mu dyambu di bumbote bu bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mpeve wuhaana ku wumosi mpova yi ndwenga, mpe Mpeve beyoyo kwandi wuhaana ku wuhiika mpova yi nzayilu. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Mpeve wuhaana ku wumosi kiminu, mpe Mpeve beyoyo kwandi wuhaana ku wuhiika minkayulu mye nyakisina zimbevo. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Ku wumosi lulendo lwe sa bimangu, ku wuhiika munkayulu we bikula, ku wuhiika dyaka munkayulu we swasisa zimpeve, ku wuhiika munkayulu we zonza zindinga zi mumpila-mumpila, ku wuhiika lulendo mu bangula zindinga. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Kansi Mpeve yimosi kwandi yikwe hidikanga misamu bemyomyo mimvimba, kwe haananga ku kadi muntu munkayulu wuswaswana bonso bu yitiidi.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nitu yimosi na binama bibingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Nitu yimosi kwandi yidi, kansi yii na binama bibingi, mpeleko binama bi nitu bibingi bidi, kansi nitu yimosi kwandi bikwe tunganga, bwabobo mpe buu Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Mu dyambu ti, yeto bamvimba mu Mpeve yimosi tubotokolo mu tunga nitu yimosi: Bayudayo hoti Bangeleke, mindongo hoti bantu bakimpwanza, bamvimba tuu bafuluka mu Mpeve yimosi.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Nitu yii na kinama kimosi kwandi ko, kansi na binama bibingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Tala ti kuulu kuteedi ti: «Bu ndembolo ba kooko, navwihulu ku nitu ko», kadi mu bobobo, kasidi dyaka kinama ki nitu ko e? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Tala ti kutu diteedi ti: «Bu ndembolo ba diisu, navwihulu ku nitu ko», kadi mu bobobo, kasidi dyaka kinama ki nitu ko e? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Tala ti nitu yimvimba diisu kwandi didi, bwedi muntu kalendi yuwila e? Tala ti nitu yimvimba kutu kwandi didi, bwedi muntu kalendi yuwila mfuku e? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Kansi Nzambi wutuula kadi kinama mu nitu bonso buu luzolo lwandi. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Tala ti binama bimvimba bii kwandi kinama kimosi, bwedi nitu yiketi beela e? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Buna, binama bibingi bidi, kansi nitu yimosi kwandi yidi.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Diisu dilendi ta ku kooko ko ti: «nii naaku nsatu ko», hoti mutu kata ku maalu ti: «nii neeno nsatu ko!» <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Bumosi mpe, bitini bi nitu bikwe yenikanga ti bilebakana bidi, mfunu bidi, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />mpe byo bi tukwe yenanga ti bii mfunu yiyingi ko, bya tukwe toma haananga buzitu. Mpe binama bi tukwe yenanga nsoni ha meso ma bantu, bya tukwe vulanga mu sweka, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />kansi byo bilembolo ba nsoni ha meso ma bantu, bii mfunu mu sweka ko. Nzambi bo kahidikila nitu mu toma haana nzitusu ku binama bi nitu, bilembolo ba mfunu yiyingi, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />mwanki nitu yilembolo ba na nkabani, kansi binama bisalasana byawu na byawu. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Tala ti kinama kimosi kina yena mpasi, binama bimvimba bina yena mpasi ha kimosi nandi. Tala ti kinama kimosi kina zitusu, binama bimvimba bina yangalala ha kimosi na yandi.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Yeno nitu yi Klisto ludi, mpe kadi muntu kinama ki nitu beyoyo kadi. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Nzambi wutuula ntete mu Dibundu zintumwa, ha nzole mimbikudi, ha tatu milongisi, mboki bakwe sanga bimangu, baa na minkayulu mye nyakisa zimbevo, mye sadisa bantu bahiika, na mye twadisa, mye zonza zindinga zi mumpila-mumpila. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Nganunu bamvimba zintumwa zidi e? Bamvimba mimbikudi midi e? Bamvimba milongisi midi e? Bamvimba bimangu bakwe sanga e? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Nganunu bamvimba minkayulu mye nyakisa zimbevo mii nawu e? Bamvimba zindinga zi mumpila-mumpila bakwe zonzanga e? Bamvimba zindinga bakwe bangulanga e? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ni hahoho, beeno na nsatu yi minkayulu mi vudi mfunu. Kansi nina lulonka bwabu nzila yivudidi zimvimba.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Minkayilu mi Mpeve na luzolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Tala ti nina zonza ndinga zi bantu, na zi zimbazi, kansi, tala ti nii na luzolo ko, nii kwandi bonso lusuku lu bandi hoti ngunga yina yuwakana. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Na lendi ba na munkayulu we bikula, na we bakudila mansweki mamvimba, na we zaba misamu mimvimba, mpe nalendi ba na kiminu kimvimba kilendi tuma ku milandu mu katuka ha kifulu ki midi, kansi ti nii na luzolo ko, muntu wumpamba kwandi nidi. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Kati ni nakabula mvwilu ani yimvimba ku bamputu, kati ti ni nayoka nitu ani kutiya, kansi ti nii na luzolo ko, nabaka ndandu ko.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Luzolo luvibudulu ludi mpe luu lufuluka mu mambote. Luzolo luzininanga ko, luzolo lukisiikisanga ko mpe lukitumpidikanga ko, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />luhidikanga misamu minsoni ko, lusosanga ndandu andi ko, lufwemanga ko, luyindulanga misamu mimbi ko. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Luzolo lukwe yangalalanga musamu wulembolo ba wulunungu ko, kansi lukwe yangalalanga kikedika. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Lukwe lemvokilanga mimvimba, lukwe kwikilanga mimvimba, lukwe sanga kivuvu mu mimvimba, lukwe vibidilanga mimvimba.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Luzolo lulendi fwa ko. Zimbikudulu zina zimbala, zindinga zina suka, nzayilu yina zimbala. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Mu dyambu ti, tukwe zabanga mu ndambu kwandi, na ndambu kwandi tukwe bikulanga, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />kansi mo maa malunga bu maakwiza, mo malembolo ba malunga maazimbala.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Bu naba mwana, nedi zonzanga bonso mwana, nedi yindulanga bonso mwana, nedi bakulanga bonso mwana. Bwabu bu nameni kula, nabikiidi ma kimwana. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Bubedidi tuna yena bonso kifwani kina lembolo toma yenika mu kitala-tala, kansi kilumbu kidi, kitwaatalasana meso na meso. Bubedidi mwa ndambu kwandi nzebi, kansi naazaba Nzambi bonso bu katomini nzabila.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Bwabu bima bitatu byaatatamana muba: kiminu, kivuvu na luzolo. Kansi mu byabitatu kima kivudidi bunene, ni luzolo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kuzonza ndinga yinzenza na mbikudulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Soseeno ntete luzolo. Beeno na nsatu yiyingi yi minkayulu mi Mpeve, sungula munkayulu we bikula. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Muntu wukwe zonzanga ndinga zinzenza, kakwe zonzanga ku bantu ko, kansi ku Nzambi, mu dyambu ti kuna mubakula muntu ko, mpe mu kimpeve kakwe zabikisilanga mansweki. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Kansi yondowo kwe bikulanga, ku bantu kakwe zonzanga mu bakudisa mu kiminu, mu basyamisa na mu babomba. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Muntu wukwe zonzanga mu ndinga yi nzenza, kwe kudisanga kiminu kyandi, kansi yondowo kwe bikulanga, Dibundu kakwe kudisanga mu kiminu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Natiidi ti yeno bamvimba luzonza zindinga zinzenza, kansi vula-vula kwe bikulanga. Yondowo kwe bikulanga, vuvudi mfunu na yondowo kwe zonzanga zindinga zinzenza, kadi ti kuba na muntu waahaana mbangudulu, mwanki Dibundu dibaka nsyamusunu. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Bwabu zimpangi zani, bwedi nabeela mfunu tala ti nizidi kuu yeno, mpe nina luzonzila mu ndinga yinzenza, ha kibuka kye lunatina musamu wu ntambudi ku Nzambi, wu nzayilu, wu mbikudulu hoti wu ndongosolo e?<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Tala ti bima bikwe lembolo ningananga, bikwe duukisanga muningu bonso hungu, hoti kisanzi, tala ti bina haana miningu mi swaswana ko, bwedi bazabila muningu wuna sika kadi kima e? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Tala ti kulumenta dina duukisa muningu wumbi, buna nani waakubama mu nwana mvita e? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Bumosi mpe kuu yeno: tala ti ludimi lweno luna duukisa misamu mimbote ko, bwedi baazabila mi luna ta e? Kuzonza ku mpamba luna zonza. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ndinga zinzenza zizingi zii mu nza, kansi, kuu ndinga yilembolo ba na mbangudulu andi ko. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Tala ti nazebi mbangudulu yi ndinga ko, nzenza naaba kuu muntu wuna zonza, mpe yondowo wuna zonza waaba nzenza kuu meno. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Ni hahoho, yeno mpe bu luu na nsatu yi minkayulu mi Mpeve, soseeno mu ba na myo, mu kitezo kivudidi, myo mikwe kudisanga Dibundu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Ni hahoho, yondowo wuna zonza mu ndinga yinzenza, bika kalomba ku Nzambi ka muhaana munkayulu we bangula. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Tala ti nina sambila mu ndinga yinzenza, mpeve ani yii mu kati di lusambulu, kansi madyela mani mana sa kima ko. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nki mfweti sa e? Naasambila na mpeve ani, kansi naasambila mpe na madyela mani. Naayimbila na mpeve ani, kansi naayimbila mpe na madyela mani. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Tala ti wuna vutula matondo ku Nzambi mu mpeve aku kwandi, bwedi yondowo wuna kuyuwa wuu ha bundu kavutudila «Ameni» mu lusambulu lwaku lumvutudulu yi matondo e? Mu dyambu ti kazebi ko misamu mi wuna ta. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ninga, wuna sambila lusambulu lumbote lu mvutudulu yi matondo, kansi wuhiika lwaamukudisa mu kiminu ko.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nina tonda Nzambi bukwe zonzanga ndinga zinzenza kuhyoka yeno bamvimba. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Kansi, mbote na zonza mu Dibundu mpova zitanu zi balendi bakula, mwanki na syamisa bahiika, na mu zonza mafunda kumi (10000) ma mpova mu ndinga zinzenza.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Mpangi zani, lubandi na nzonzolo bonso zi baala bafyoti ko. Kansi mu misamu mimbi, beeno bonso mwa baala bansombe, kansi mu mayindu, beeno bantu bakula. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Wusonama mu misiku ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">«Mu bantu bandinga zihiika, na mu minwa mi banzenza naazonzila ku mukangu bewuwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">mpe kati nina sadila bobo, baanyuwila ko.»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Mfumu teedi bobo.<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Ni hahoho, ndinga zinzenza zii kidimbu ko ku minkwikidi, kansi ku balembolo ba minkwikidi, kidimbu kidi. Mbikudulu kii kidimbu ko ku balembolo ba minkwikidi, kansi ku minkwikidi, kidimbu kidi.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Tala ti Dibundu dimvimba diyonzamani huma hamosi, mpe bantu bamvimba bana zonza ndinga zinzenza, mboki bantu balembolo we zaba hoti yobobo balembolo ba minkwikidi bakotidi hoho, nganunu baata ko ti kulahuka luna lahuka e? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Kansi tala ti bamvimba bana bikula, mpe ti muntu wumosi wulembolo ba munkwikidi hoti muntu wulembolo zaba kotidi, buna muntu bewowo waabakula masumu mandi, mpe waafundusu mu mimvimba mi kana yuwa, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />buna mansweki ma mutima andi mazabakana, na wafukama luse ha nsi mu sambila Nzambi, bu kaata ti: «wukedika, Nzambi wuu ha kati dyeto!»<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludedomo mu Dibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Mpangi zani, nki bwabu tuna sa e? Mu ntangu yi lukwe yonzamanga, wumosi mu yeno waayimbila mukunga, wuhiika waalonga, wuhiika dyaka waabikula, wumosi waazonza ndinga yinzenza, wuhiika waabangula. Bika mimvimba bemyomyo miba ntungulu yi Dibundu! <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Tala ti kuu na bantu bana zonza ndinga yinzenza, bika bole hoti batatu bazonza, kadi muntu na kilokola kyandi, mpe muntu wuhiika kabangula. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Tala ti kunaani muntu wabangula, bika bahuza napii ha kati di lukutukunu, na kazonza ku yandi bende, mpe na Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Ku yobobo bana bikula, bika bole hoti batatu bazonza, na bahiika bafyongonina mi bana ta. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Tala ti muntu wuhiika wuu hoho tambudi mbikudulu, bika yondowo wuna zonza kaba napii. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Yeno bamvimba lulendi bikula kweno, kansi wumosi-wumosi, mwanki bantu bamvimba balongoka mpe basyamusu. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Mpeve zi mimbikudi zikwe tumiminanga mimbikudi, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />mu dyambu ti, Nzambi kaa Nzambi yi mvwanzi ko, kansi yi kiyenge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Bonso mu Mabundu mamvimba ma balongo, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />bika bakento beno bahuzanga napii mu zinkutukunu, mu dyambu ti baa na luve mu zonza ko, kansi bafweti tumama bonso buna ta misiku. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Tala ti batiidi mu zaba musamu, bafuula babakala bawu ku nzo, mu dyambu ti, buu bumbote ko mukento kazonza ha kati di Dibundu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Bwedi, luna banza ti Mambu ma Nzambi ku yeno mafuma e? Hoti yeno hika lutambula mo e? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Tala ti muntu wuna banzila ti mumbikudi kadi hoti munkayulu wu Mpeve wuu nandi, bika kazaba ti misamu mi nina lusonikina ntumunu yi Mfumu yidi. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Tala ti kazebi wo ko, Nzambi mpe ka muzebi ko!<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ni hahoho, mpangi zani, beeno na nsatu yiyingi yi munkayulu we bikula, mpe lukakidilandi bantu mu zonza ndinga zinzenza ko, <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />kansi bika mimvimba mihilama bonso bufwanakani, mpe mu ludedomo.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mfulukulu mu bafwa yi Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Zimpangi, nina lubambula moyo ti, Musamu Wumbote wu nalusamunina, wu lutambula, na wu ludi bakangama nakekete. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ni mu Musamu bewowo luna bakila mpulusu tala ti lukebidi wo bonso bu nalusamunina wo, ti kabobo ko, kiminu kyeno ki keti ba kimpamba.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Natekidi luhaana ndongosolo yi natambudi meno bende: Klisto wufwa mu dyambu di masumu meto, bonso bu basonika wo mu Masonama. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Bamuzika, kilumbu kitatu, wufuluka mu bafwa, bonso bu basonika wo mu Masonama. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Wuyenikina Sefase, mboki ku zintumwa kumi na zole. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Mboki, mu kilokola kimosi, wuyenika ku zimpangi ziba lutangu kuhyoka nkama tanu (500): babingi ha kati dyawu bakidi bamoyo, mpe mwa ndambu yifwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Mboki, wuyenika ku Zaki, na ku zintumwa zimvimba.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ku manima me yenikina bantu bamvimba, wunyenikina mpe, meno nidi bonso mwana wubutuka wulembolo lunga zingonda. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Mu dyambu ti, meno mvudidi bufyoti mu zintumwa, mpe nafwanani ko ti bantumisina ntumwa, mu dyambu ti meno nafyetikisa Dibundu di Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Kansi mu mulemvo wu Nzambi, nidi bonso bu nidi, mpe mulemvo andi mu meno wuba wumpamba ko. Kansi, mu yawu bamvimba ni meno navula sala, ka meno ko, kansi ni mulemvo wu Nzambi wuu naani. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Ni hahoho, ni diba ti meno hoti yawu, Musamu Wumbote wu tuna samuna, wawowo wu lukwikidi.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfulukulu yi bafwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Tala ti tuna samuna ti Klisto wufuluka mu bafwa, bwedi bahiika mu yeno balendi teela ti kuu mfulukulu yi bafwa ko e? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Tala ti mfulukulu yi bafwa yidi ko, buna Klisto mpe kafuluka mu bafwa ko, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />mpe tala ti Klisto kafuluka mu bafwa ko, buna ndongosolo eto yimpamba yidi, mpe kiminu kyeto kimpamba kidi. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Mpe yeto tuna yenika bonso zimbangi ziluvunu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, mu dyambu ti tuta kimbangi kiluvunu mu Nzambi ti wufulukisa Klisto mu bafwa. Tala ti bafwa bakwe fulukanga ko, buna Nzambi kafulukisa mpe Klisto ko. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Tala ti bafwa bakwe fulukanga ko, buna Klisto mpe kafuluka mu bafwa ko. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Mpe tala ti Klisto kafuluka mu bafwa ko, kiminu kyeno kimpamba kidi, lwakidi mu masumu meno, <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />mpe bantu bebobo bafwa mu Klisto, bazimbala badi. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Tala ti tutudidi kivuvu kyeto mu Klisto mu luzingu belulu kwandi, buna yeto tuhyokidi bantu bamvimba mu kyadi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Kansi wukedika ti, Klisto wufuluka mu bafwa, yandi ni wuntete wufuluka mu bantu bafwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Bonso lufwa bu luyizila mu muntu wumosi, bwabobo mpe mfulukulu mu bafwa yiyizila mu muntu wumosi. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Mpe bonso bantu bamvimba bakwe fwanga mu Adami, ni bwabobo mpe bantu bamvimba baatambula luzingu mu Klisto, <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />kansi kadi muntu na ntangu andi: Klisto wuntete, mboki yobobo bavwihulu ku Klisto baafuluka mu bafwa mu ntangu yi kaavutuka. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Mboki ni nsukunu yaakwiza, Klisto bu kaafukisa luyaalu lumvimba, kimfumu kimvimba na lulendo lumvimba, mbo kavutula kimfumu ku yondowo wuu Nzambi na Tata. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Mu dyambu ti, Klisto fweti yaala natee Nzambi bu katuula mitantu myandi mimvimba ku nsye bitambi byandi. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Mutantu wu mansukina wu kaafukisa, ni lufwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Mu dyambu ti wusonama: «Nzambi wutuula mimvimba ku nsye bitambi byandi.» Kansi Nzambi kaa mu kati di «Bima bimvimba» ko, yandi wutuula bimvimba ku nsye bitambi byandi. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Bimvimba bu byaaba ku nsye bitambi bi Klisto, buna yandi bende, Mwana, waaba ku nsye luyaalu lu Nzambi wutuula bimvimba ku nsye bitambi byandi, mwanki Nzambi kaba mimvimba mu bamvimba.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Nki bakwe sosanga mu baka, bantu bakwe botokongo mu dyambu di bafwa e? Tala ti bafwa bakwe fulukanga ko, bila nki bakwe botokolongo mu dyambu dyawu e? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Bila nki, yeto bende, tukwe bwaninanga nsisi zi lufwa ntangu zimvimba e? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Zimpangi, bilumbu bimvimba, nakwe vuukanga mu lufwa. Nina luteela wo mu dyambu ti, nakwe kisiikisanga mu yeno bu ludi bakangama nakekete mu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Tala ti ni mu misamu mi kimuntu kwandi nanwanina mvita na bibulu binsisi ku mbanza Efeso, nkye ndandu nina baka e? Tala ti bafwa bakwe fulukanga ko, buna, «bika tudyeeno, na tunweeno, mu dyambu ti mbazi twaafwa!»<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Ka luhunukandi ko: «bakundi bambi bakwe bihisanga nkadulu zimbote.» <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Vutukileeno mabanza meno mambote bonso bufwanakani na luholandi masumu ko. Bahiika ha kati dyeno bazebi Nzambi ko, nina teela bobo mu lufwisa nsoni.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nitu zi bantu bafuluka mu bafwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Kansi, ti muntu wuna ta: bwedi bafwa bakwe fulukilanga e? Na mu nkye nitu bakwe vutukilanga e? <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Muntu wu kizengi wudi! Bikwe kunanga bifweti teka fwa tekila bimena. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Kima ki wuna kuna, mbutu yinaani kwandi yidi, yilendi ba mbutu yi bele hoti yihiika, kansi ka muti wabende ko waamena. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Mboki Nzambi waamuhaana nitu ku muti bonso bu katidi, mpe ku kadi mbutu waahaana nitu yimufwanakani.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Bima bimvimba bimoyo bii na nitu yimosi ko: nitu zi bantu ziswaswana zidi na zi bibulu, nitu zi zinuni ziswaswana zidi na zi zimbizi.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kudi mpe na nitu zi mazulu na nitu zi ha butoto, kansi, kulezima ku nitu zi ku mazulu kuswaswana kudi na kulezima ku nitu zi ha butoto. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Ntangu wuu na kulezima kwandi, ngonda mpe wuu na kulezima kwandi, zimbwetete mpe zii na kulezima kwawu. Mpe ha kati di zimbwetete, kulezima ku lubwetete lumosi kuswaswana kudi na lubwetete luhiika.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Bumosi mpe mu musamu wu mfulukulu yi bafwa. Nitu bu yikwe ziikungu, yikwe bolanga yikwe banga, kansi bu yaafuluka, yaaba nitu yikwe lembolo bolanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Yikwe ziikungu yi lembolo ba mfunu na yilebakana, bu yaafuluka yaaba nitu yinkembo na yikinda. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Yikwe ziikungu nitu yi kimuntu, kansi bu yaafuluka, yaaba nitu yi kimpeve. Kuu na nitu yi kimuntu, mpe kuu na nitu yi kimpeve. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ni hahoho, wusonama ti: «Muntu wuntete, Adami, wuyiza ba muntu wumoyo», kansi Adami di mansukina wuba wufuluka mu Mpeve yikwe haananga luzingu. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ka nitu yi kimpeve ko yikwe tekilanga, kansi ni yi kimuntu, ha manima ni nitu yi kimpeve. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Muntu wuntete wufuma mu butoto, wuhiduku mu fundu-fundu, muntu wunzole, wufuma ku mazulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Bonso buu muntu wu kinza, bwabobo mpe bwaaba bantu ba kinza. Mpe bonso buu muntu wu mazulu, bwabobo mpe bwaaba bantu ba mazulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Bumosi mpe bu tuhiduku mu kifwani ki muntu wuhidiku mu fundu-fundu, twaalwatila mpe kifwani ki muntu wufuma ku mazulu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Zimpangi, ebu ntiidi mu ta: nsuni na menga bilendi byadila kimfumu ki Nzambi ko, bima bikwe bolanga bilendi byadila fwa di bima bikwe lembolo bolanga ko.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Taleeno, nina luteela mansweki: yeto bamvimba twaafwa ko, kansi yeto bamvimba baatukitula <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mu mwa ntangu, mu mbwetolo yi meso mu muningu wu kulumenta dimanunu. Mu dyambu ti, kulumeta bu dyaatendana, buna bafwa baafuluka mulembolo fwa dyaka, mpe yeto baatukitula. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Mu dyambu ti, nitu beyiyi yikwe bolanga, yifweti lwata nitu yikwe lembolo bolanga, mpe nitu beyiyi yikwe fwanga, yifweti lwata nitu yikwe lembolo fwanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Nitu beyoyo yikwe bolanga, bu yaalwata nitu yikwe lembolo bolanga, mpe nitu beyoyo yikwe fwanga, bu yaalwata nitu yikwe lembolo fwanga, buna Mambu bemomo masonama maalunga: «Lufwa lwaababedisi, mpe nungunu yilungidi!<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Ngeye lufwa, nungunu aku kwedi yidi e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Ngeye lufwa, kiba kii na lulendo lwe honda, kwedi kidi e?»<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Kiba kikwe natanga ku lufwa ni masumu, mpe kima kikwe haananga lulendo ku masumu, ni misiku. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Kansi, tuvutudileeno Nzambi matondo, yandi kwe tuhananga nungunu mu nzila yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Mpangi zani zizola, beeno bakangama nakekete, wulembolo ningusu. Tomeeno sala bumbote mu kisalu ki Mfumu, zabeeno ti, kisalu kyeno mu Mfumu kii kimpamba.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nyonzokolo yi minkayulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Mu myomyo mitadidi nyonzokolo yi minkayulu mu dyambu di bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, seeno bonso buna tuma bo ku Mabundu ma ku kizunga yi Ngalatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Mu kilumbu kilumingu, kadi muntu ha kati dyeno, katuulanga ha lweka mu nzo andi, byo bi kaalenda mu baka, bonso buu lubaku lwandi, mwanki lulembolo kingila natee bu naakwiza mu yonzika byo. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Bu naakwiza, mbo natambika ku mbanza Yelusalemi bantu balusoodidi mu nata minkayulu, mpe mbo nabahaana mikanda. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Tala ti bufweni ti meno mpe nenda, buna ha kimosi twaazyeta nawu.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makani ma Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Bu naahyokila mu kizunga ki Masedwani, naakwiza kuu yeno, mu dyambu ti koko naahyokila. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Bulenda ba ti naaba mwa bilumbu neeno koko, mpe ndendi hyokisila nsungi yi kyozi kingolo koko, lwaansadisa mu tatamana nzyetolo ani konso-konso ku nina kwenda. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ntiidi ko naluyena kwandi bu nina hyoka, kansi nsiidi kivuvu ti, naazakala neeno mwa ntangu yifwana, tala ti Mfumu haanini wo luve.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Kansi naazakala ku mbanza yi Efeso natee mu mukembo wu Pentekoti, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />mu dyambu ti mwelo wuwunene banzibudidi koko mu sala kisalu kimbote, mpeleko mitantu mimingi mii koko.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Tala ti Timote wizidi, seeno myo mifwanakani mwanki kalembolo ba na bunkuta ha kati dyeno, mu dyambu ti kisalu ki Mfumu kakwe salanga bonso meno. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nakani muntu ka muvwezandi ko! Musadiseeno mwanki katatamana nzyetolo andi ye kwiza ku meno mu kiyenge, mu dyambu ti meno nina mu kingila ha kimosi na zimpangi mu kiminu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Mu dyambu di mpangi eto Apolose, natomini musyamisa bubwingi mwanki kiza kalubumina ha kimosi na zimpangi zihiika, kansi bwabu kaa na makani mu sadila bo ko. Bu kaabaka hwakisa, mbo kenda koko.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntumunu zimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Kayeeno meso, kangameeno nakekete mu kiminu, beeno na kibakala, syameeno. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Mimvimba mi luna sa hidikeeno myo mu luzolo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Zimpangi, eyi ni ntumunu yihiika yi nina luhaana: luzebi ti bantu ba nzo yi Sitefanasi, ni mimbutu mintete mu kizunga ki Akayi na batoma kukihaana mu sadisa bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Tumamangeeno ku bantu ba bobobo na yobobo bamvimba bakwe salanga, mpe bakwe yenanga mpasi ha kimosi nawu.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Nina yangalala mu yena Sitefanasi, na Fotunatuse na Akayikuse, mu dyambu ti yawu bahingani ha kibuka kyeno ku meeno. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Mu dyambu ti balembikidi mutima ani na wuweno. Bantu ba bobo zabeeno mu bazangisa.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Mabundu ma kizunga ki Aziya malutambikidi mbote. Akilase na Pilisile na dibundu dikwe yonzamanga mu nzo awu, balutambikidi mbote zizingi mu Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Mpangi zimvimba zilutambikidi mbote. Haanasaneeno yeno na yeno mbote ye bumbasana mu kimpangi.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Meno Pawuli, nina sonika mbote bezizi mu kooko kwani.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Tala ti muntu katiidi Mfumu ko, bika kaba wusingu! Malanata! Mfumu, yiza!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Bika Mfumu Yesu ka lusakumuna!<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Yeno bamvimba nalutiidi mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>